  "body_text": "这个月给新店整理了一批歌单，挑了几首出来放这里大家可以试试看\n感谢\n李洋分享的歌单\n以及对不同时段适合听的音乐类型的理解分享，受用！\n雷鬼风格的\nCool and Loving\n是一首dj向Barrington Levy致敬的re-mix\n小狮子固定曲目\n2.\nSlightly Stoopid\nCloser to the Sun\n当前奏吉他想起时，瞬间把我秒掉了，算什么风格呢，某种rock吧，歌词有些自嘲\n3.\nLauryn Hill\nCan't Take My Eyes Off of You\n以前听没怎么在意，这个版本现在听好好听，出自获奖的专辑 The Miseducation of Lauryn Hill\n给小狮子的每日固定跳舞曲目 lol\n4.\nChuck Berry\nYou Are My Sunshine\n新找到的一个版本，喜欢！😄\n5. 群星为抗癌高歌的\nJust Stand Up!\n听完能量满满 小狮子很喜欢的一首歌\n6.\nElla Fitzgerald; Louis Jordan\nBaby It's Cold Outside\nLouis Jordan的声音像棉花糖一样软绵绵的 听着好舒服 像在抚摸你的神经一样\n突然想起了灌篮高手里的安西教练的。下巴 。。额额额\n7.\nThe Shanghai Restoration Project\nNanking Road (Instrumental)\n没想到音频库里能这首曲目，这个是从李洋的推荐歌单里发现的一组曲子，这张专辑的曲子都很不错，听着二胡那节奏脑补了一个带着墨镜，帽子，扎着辫子，吊儿郎当混迹街头的二混子，梦回清末民初\n8.\nDJ Shadow; Run the Jewels\nNobody Speak\n歌词很火爆，beats很变幻，听完歌我想去扒这部美剧了\nBLue\n9.\nMarcus Miller\nHigher Ground\n超带感的bass\n10.\nZiggy Marley\nFriend\nBecause you are my friend!\n上面的歌都没有黑胶，本月黑胶是一张钢琴曲\n前阵子没了很多爵士的唱片，慢慢接受中，有些曲子真的感受不到它的好在什么地方，听着不是很轻松，下面这张是我和小狮子都很喜欢的，听起来很轻松",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n         这个月给新店整理了一批歌单，挑了几首出来放这里大家可以试试看\n        </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n         感谢\n         <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAwNjI0NTg5NQ==&amp;mid=2652146253&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=a6867ec66b5a9a4c6e4bc4d156b8a5cb&amp;chksm=80f07125b787f83370686767d469d35ceebb3df4e0438bb7cb000f25287443e154d64ab10568&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=21&amp;srcid=0219F0cSFneFe6mlBJbCaqxo&amp;pass_ticket=yrlSdHV C/hPYdnLNN2PCvm692inGSlFR2zyOFMAFGDoQfqStYy3tzg wBXGaV0F#wechat_redirect\" target=\"_blank\">\n          李洋分享的歌单\n         </a>\n         以及对不同时段适合听的音乐类型的理解分享，受用！\n        </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal;\">\n<li>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n           雷鬼风格的\n           <em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n             Cool and Loving\n            </span>\n</em>\n           是一首dj向Barrington Levy致敬的re-mix\n          </p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<qqmusic albumid=\"003TGI9O1sl2KH\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000003TGI9O1sl2KH.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://ws.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C100001FMTZn1Q9sOw.m4a?fromtag=46\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"001FMTZn1Q9sOw\" music_name=\"Cool And Loving\" musicid=\"5941347\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"001FMTZn1Q9sOw\" play_length=\"242\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"Barrington Levy - Barrington Levy's DJ Counteraction (11 Classic Hits Re-Charged)\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=Barrington%20Levy%20-%20Barrington%20Levy%27s%20DJ%20Counteraction%20(11%20Classic%20Hits%20Re-Charged)&amp;music_name=Cool%20And%20Loving&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000003TGI9O1sl2KH.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9bUUfjKsJKqcELBYglYC8O6cXOu5lXwnap3xePWAB0FpVs7GLy3GPhr8qQqnjGQQibe8l7YCcEB2A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 252px;height: 246px;\"/>\n          小狮子固定曲目\n         \n        </p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         2.\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          Slightly Stoopid\n         </span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n           Closer to the Sun\n          </span>\n</em>\n</p>\n<p>\n         当前奏吉他想起时，瞬间把我秒掉了，算什么风格呢，某种rock吧，歌词有些自嘲\n        </p>\n<p>\n<qqmusic albumid=\"003PzwJB10SuUn\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000003PzwJB10SuUn.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://ws.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C100004aQC3M1Kp5DS.m4a?fromtag=46\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"002nA60z4a6l1c\" music_name=\"Closer To The Sun\" musicid=\"3454086\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"002nA60z4a6l1c\" play_length=\"145\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"Slightly Stoopid - Closer To The Sun\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=Slightly%20Stoopid%20-%20Closer%20To%20The%20Sun&amp;music_name=Closer%20To%20The%20Sun&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000003PzwJB10SuUn.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9bUUfjKsJKqcELBYglYC8OAFVKyrsibeIMrtfBsycox7WBLFKN3yJ7kicwI9nVD1TXBq61JOPIbFMg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         3.\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          Lauryn Hill\n         </span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"text-align: center;color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n           Can't Take My Eyes Off of You\n          </span>\n</em>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n         以前听没怎么在意，这个版本现在听好好听，出自获奖的专辑 The Miseducation of Lauryn Hill\n        </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n         给小狮子的每日固定跳舞曲目 lol\n        </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<qqmusic albumid=\"0042Gst20mj8hC\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M0000042Gst20mj8hC.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://ws.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C100001E4izU2lvYQx.m4a?fromtag=46\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"001E4izU2lvYQx\" music_name=\"Can't Take My Eyes Off Of You\" musicid=\"1620089\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"001E4izU2lvYQx\" play_length=\"221\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"Lauryn Hill - The Miseducation Of Lauryn Hill\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=Lauryn%20Hill%20-%20The%20Miseducation%20Of%20Lauryn%20Hill&amp;music_name=Can%27t%20Take%20My%20Eyes%20Off%20Of%20You&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M0000042Gst20mj8hC.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9bUUfjKsJKqcELBYglYC8Omia4pfE7JtatDL7mxXJMYsmgN2w8eJlgAn0iazmFRcnFJEgrLsSJ0icRA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n         4.\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          Chuck Berry\n          <em>\n           You Are My Sunshine\n          </em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n         新找到的一个版本，喜欢！😄\n        </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<qqmusic albumid=\"004BxRlW2FucBu\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000004BxRlW2FucBu.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://ws.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C100001C8Mjo185LH0.m4a?fromtag=46\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"001C8Mjo185LH0\" music_name=\"You Are My Sunshine\" musicid=\"1217864\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"001C8Mjo185LH0\" play_length=\"169\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"Chuck Berry - Have Mercy -  His Complete Chess Recordings 1969 - 1974\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=Chuck%20Berry%20-%20Have%20Mercy%20-%20%20His%20Complete%20Chess%20Recordings%201969%20-%201974&amp;music_name=You%20Are%20My%20Sunshine&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000004BxRlW2FucBu.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9bUUfjKsJKqcELBYglYC8ONVicUth9OlLop4nN4qibdZ921Sxvg4QIJrEDbTHpYvibWFSJDGR1iatSYQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         5. 群星为抗癌高歌的\n         <em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n           Just Stand Up!\n          </span>\n</em>\n</p>\n<p>\n         听完能量满满 小狮子很喜欢的一首歌\n        </p>\n<p>\n<qqmusic albumid=\"000aNxh20fEtSj\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000000aNxh20fEtSj.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://ws.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C100002rDayz0vgxfv.m4a?fromtag=46\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"002rDayz0vgxfv\" music_name=\"JUST STAND UP!\" musicid=\"1223783\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"002rDayz0vgxfv\" play_length=\"214\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"Artists Stand Up To Cancer - JUST STAND UP!\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=Artists%20Stand%20Up%20To%20Cancer%20-%20JUST%20STAND%20UP!&amp;music_name=JUST%20STAND%20UP!&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000000aNxh20fEtSj.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n9bUUfjKsJKqcELBYglYC8OrYMqZqAYhVM5O3hicJvFa4xXvxra8PEEnzjbBaocfmaDPsicicBGyeNiaA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         6.\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          Ella Fitzgerald; Louis Jordan\n          <em>\n           Baby It's Cold Outside\n          </em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n         Louis Jordan的声音像棉花糖一样软绵绵的 听着好舒服 像在抚摸你的神经一样\n        </p>\n<p>\n         突然想起了灌篮高手里的安西教练的。下巴 。。额额额\n        </p>\n<p>\n<qqmusic albumid=\"004SgR0z12SmN9\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000004SgR0z12SmN9.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://ws.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C1000048HxJy17vzI3.m4a?fromtag=46\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"000uruoI4AJ3RZ\" music_name=\"Baby It's Cold Outside\" musicid=\"8148451\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"000uruoI4AJ3RZ\" play_length=\"161\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"Ella Fitzgerald;Louis Jordan - Ella &amp; Friends\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=Ella%20Fitzgerald%3BLouis%20Jordan%20-%20Ella%20%26%20Friends&amp;music_name=Baby%20It%27s%20Cold%20Outside&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000004SgR0z12SmN9.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9bUUfjKsJKqcELBYglYC8OJicweG8e0WPSyQvgZfmzSdziat4npCvCCljZ0ka6p7LktM5YTYFm1AkQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         7.\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          The Shanghai Restoration Project\n          <em>\n           Nanking Road (Instrumental)\n          </em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n         没想到音频库里能这首曲目，这个是从李洋的推荐歌单里发现的一组曲子，这张专辑的曲子都很不错，听着二胡那节奏脑补了一个带着墨镜，帽子，扎着辫子，吊儿郎当混迹街头的二混子，梦回清末民初\n        </p>\n<p>\n<qqmusic albumid=\"001jcOHy1TfCGH\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000001jcOHy1TfCGH.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://ws.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C1000033gEZp380fm2.m4a?fromtag=46\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"001swoCs0xrqyp\" music_name=\"Nanking Road\" musicid=\"101502192\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"001swoCs0xrqyp\" play_length=\"220\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"The Shanghai Restoration Project - Instrumentals\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=The%20Shanghai%20Restoration%20Project%20-%20Instrumentals&amp;music_name=Nanking%20Road&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000001jcOHy1TfCGH.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9bUUfjKsJKqcELBYglYC8OPDiaDeJJribzZ6DaPMAsVicn1ovYDQFSLXfY2XlSySGAOLcRSNn7PVzmg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         8.\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          DJ Shadow; Run the Jewels\n         </span>\n<em>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n           Nobody Speak\n          </span>\n</em>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ff4c00;\">\n<em>\n           歌词很火爆，beats很变幻，听完歌我想去扒这部美剧了\n          </em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ff4c00;\">\n<em>\n<qqmusic albumid=\"000bQ9D94BJUmV\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000000bQ9D94BJUmV.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://ws.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C1000035cGXa24Gzcx.m4a?fromtag=46\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"0035cGXa24Gzcx\" music_name=\"Nobody Speak\" musicid=\"202292420\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"0035cGXa24Gzcx\" play_length=\"195\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"DJ Shadow;Run The Jewels - Silicon Valley (Music from the HBO Original Series)\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=DJ%20Shadow%3BRun%20The%20Jewels%20-%20Silicon%20Valley%20(Music%20from%20the%20HBO%20Original%20Series)&amp;music_name=Nobody%20Speak&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000000bQ9D94BJUmV.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<span style=\"color:#ff4c00;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n         BLue\n         <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9bUUfjKsJKqcELBYglYC8OMYumN3a0BYpb0j1qKfgJkl9Hh1ZenmrbtlwI1u7hrGBXqFExO366dw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         9.\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          Marcus Miller\n          <em>\n           Higher Ground\n          </em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n         超带感的bass\n        </p>\n<p>\n<qqmusic albumid=\"000LnSDb3Vs609\" albumurl=\"https://y.gtimg.cn/music/photo_new/T002R68x68M000000LnSDb3Vs609.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://ws.stream.qqmusic.qq.com/C100004VdAUg0byAhW.m4a?fromtag=46\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"\" mid=\"004VdAUg0byAhW\" music_name=\"Higher Ground\" musicid=\"4735113\" musictype=\"1\" otherid=\"004VdAUg0byAhW\" play_length=\"310\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"Marcus Miller - Marcus\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=Marcus%20Miller%20-%20Marcus&amp;music_name=Higher%20Ground&amp;albumurl=https%3A%2F%2Fy.gtimg.cn%2Fmusic%2Fphoto_new%2FT002R68x68M000000LnSDb3Vs609.jpg&amp;musictype=1\">\n</qqmusic>\n</p>\n<p>\n         10.\n         <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n          Ziggy Marley\n          <em>\n           Friend\n          </em>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n         Because you are my friend!\n        </p>\n<p>\n<qqmusic albumid=\"\" albumurl=\"http://singerimg.kugou.com/uploadpic/softhead/400/20140414/20140414172106651708.jpg\" audiourl=\"http://fs.open.kugou.com/79d6da5dc083a0dcdc430bbf7abb42b7/5a9eb3ec/G012/M0A/1A/09/rIYBAFUMCFKAQhmlACqmh7cbn70484.mp3\" class=\"res_iframe qqmusic_iframe js_editor_qqmusic\" frameborder=\"0\" jumpurlkey=\"1rn204d\" mid=\"\" music_name=\"Friend\" musicid=\"2969208\" musictype=\"2\" otherid=\"1rn2058\" play_length=\"174\" scrolling=\"no\" singer=\"Ziggy  Marley - Love  Is  My  Religion\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/qqmusic_tmpl&amp;singer=Ziggy%20%20Marley%20-%20Love%20%20Is%20%20My%20%20Religion&amp;music_name=Friend&amp;albumurl=http%3A%2F%2Fsingerimg.kugou.com%2Fuploadpic%2Fsofthead%2F400%2F20140414%2F20140414172106651708.jpg&amp;musictype=2\">\n</qqmusic>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n9bUUfjKsJKqcELBYglYC8OXdXpGhEUVbUymILhoibwCgS9IDsyibvNo2zCzq7WAYWlCdp2MlvVfTFg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         上面的歌都没有黑胶，本月黑胶是一张钢琴曲\n         <img src=\"https://res.wx.qq.com/mpres/htmledition/images/icon/common/emotion_panel/smiley/smiley_13.png\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:20px;vertical-align:text-bottom;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n         前阵子没了很多爵士的唱片，慢慢接受中，有些曲子真的感受不到它的好在什么地方，听着不是很轻松，下面这张是我和小狮子都很喜欢的，听起来很轻松\n        </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4nic6owERgUCysuqDoWfMBYgnorFlfsreWaTuSD6fwPpibQPpC5uY6mpap7d5jMDCKFiccyrEdylxARgw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"text-align: center;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
